# SNDCLASS (UE USoundClass): sound classes are `.dasset` assets (Type SoundClassDef: Parent, Volume, Pitch) under
# Content/Audio/Classes - Master, and Music / Effects / Voice parented to it; a `.desound` (SNDW 2) names its class
# by GUID, the player's volume is kept per class asset. Water_Falls.desce plays S_WaterfallLoop.desound (Effects).
# Sound is not a picture: the log proof is the editor log the player keeps beside the frames (scn-latest/editor.log).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/Water_Falls.desce
Дано run Open "Audio/Classes/Music.dasset"
# Тогда [classes_tree]: the data asset panel shows Parent = Master, Volume 1.0, Pitch 1.0 (UE SoundClass Details).
Тогда classes_tree Music.dasset open: Parent = Master, Volume 1.0, Pitch 1.0
Когда run Open "Audio/Water/S_WaterfallLoop.desound"
# Тогда [sound_class_pick]: the sound document's Class field shows Effects; its list holds the four classes.
Тогда sound_class_pick S_WaterfallLoop.desound open: Class shows «Effects», the list holds Master, Music, Effects, Voice
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 1
# Тогда [mix_log]: the log holds ONE "[Audio]" rebuild line with "4 classes" and no "names no sound class" /
# "is not in the mix" line.
Тогда mix_log the waterfall scene in Play; editor.log: one [Audio] rebuild line with «4 classes», no «names no sound class», no «is not in the mix»
Когда run Action "Stop"
